        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maggie Q, Margaret Denise Quigley, Len Wiseman, Bruce Willis, Will Kemp, Sylvester McCoy, William Hope\n- Works: Live Free or Die Hard, Nikita, Slumber\n- Roles: John McClane\n\nFacts:\n- Margaret Denise Quigley was born on May 22, 1979, and is professionally known as Maggie Q.\n- Maggie Q is an American actress and model.\n- Len Wiseman directed the film Live Free or Die Hard.\n- Bruce Willis stars in Live Free or Die Hard as John McClane.\n- Maggie Q is known for starring in the action film Live Free or Die Hard.\n- Maggie Q played the title role in The CW action-thriller series Nikita, which aired from 2010 to 2013.\n- The film Slumber stars Maggie Q, Will Kemp, Sylvester McCoy, and William Hope.",
